# ── OS / editor cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── On-device model weights (large binary build artifact) ──────────────────
# model/onnx/model_quantized.onnx is ~129 MB — over GitHub's 100 MB file limit,
# so a push would be rejected. It's regenerated from a trained checkpoint with:
#   spike/install_model.sh spike/model_prod <version>
# The small spec files (config.json, tokenizer.json, model_version.json) ARE
# committed, so only the weights need regenerating after a clone.
model/onnx/

# ── Optional: vendored runtime (~62 MB of ONNX WASM + the bundled lib) ──────
# Regenerable: spike/node/build_transformers_bundle.sh, plus copying the
# onnxruntime-web *.wasm files into vendor/. Uncomment for a source-only repo
# (the extension then won't run until vendor/ is rebuilt).
# vendor/
